COMPILATION OF: E48D7

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D7

   1 a 0000 E48D7:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] STORE INTO a static CHARACTER VARYING: does DR
   4 a 0006      rewrite the LEADING LENGTH BYTE (E48C8 pins the cell as the
   5 a 0006      two-length-byte cell measured by E48C8, which used a NON-EMPTY
   6 a 0006      initial only, and does the pool grow? */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl s char(10) varying static initial('AB');
   9 c 0006   s = 'CDE';
  10 c 0013   put list('S=', s);
  11 c 0033   stop;
  12 a 0036 end E48D7;

CODE SIZE = 0036
DATA AREA = 0011
FREE SYMS = 389F
END  COMPILATION
